{"content_hash": "4eebae0fb4b28e46", "version_id": 101, "article_id": 11, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Scientists Fix a Small Mistake in a Science Paper", "title_zh": "科学家改了一篇论文里的小错误", "topic": "science", "source": "nature", "source_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-11244-6", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51733627413_8ff72ca7da_b.jpg", "credit": "₡ґǘșϯγ Ɗᶏ Ⱪᶅṏⱳդ · cc0 1.0 · via flickr"}, "published_date": "2026-10-06", "word_count": 139, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "A team of scientists wrote a paper about hydrogen. Later, they found a small mistake in a picture. They wrote a correction.", "lead_zh": "一个科学家团队写了一篇关于氢气的论文。后来，他们发现图里有个小错误。他们写了一个更正。", "preview": "A team of scientists wrote a paper about hydrogen. The paper came out on 9 September 2026. The scientists work at MIT in the United States. ", "preview_zh": "一个科学家团队写了一篇关于氢气的论文。论文在2026年9月9日发表。这些科学家在美国的麻省理工学院工作。他们的论文发表在一本著名的科学杂志《自然》上。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 91, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e099b16/content/audio/11/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 59.0, "size_bytes": 357840, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 162, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e099b16/content/data/versions/101.json", "paragraphs": ["A team of scientists wrote a paper about hydrogen. The paper came out on 9 September 2026. The scientists work at MIT in the United States. Their paper is in a famous science magazine called Nature.", "Later, the team found a small mistake. In one picture, a bar had the wrong name. The bar said 'Pd-Ag under OCP'. But the right name is 'Pd under OCP'. It was only a name problem.", "The scientists wrote a correction. They put it in Nature on 6 October 2026. They fixed the name in the online paper and in the PDF. The science in the paper did not change.", "The paper is about a way to get hydrogen out of a material. The scientists used a metal called palladium. This metal helps the process work better. Hydrogen is important for clean energy."], "paragraphs_zh": ["一个科学家团队写了一篇关于氢气的论文。论文在2026年9月9日发表。这些科学家在美国的麻省理工学院工作。他们的论文发表在一本著名的科学杂志《自然》上。", "后来，团队发现了一个小错误。在一张图里，一个柱子的名字写错了。柱子上写着“Pd-Ag under OCP”。但正确的名字是“Pd under OCP”。这只是一个名字的问题。", "科学家们写了一个更正。他们在2026年10月6日把它发表在《自然》上。他们修改了在线论文和PDF里的名字。论文里的科学内容没有改变。", "这篇论文讲的是从材料中提取氢气的方法。科学家们使用了一种叫钯的金属。这种金属让这个过程效果更好。氢气对清洁能源很重要。"], "body": "A team of scientists wrote a paper about hydrogen. The paper came out on 9 September 2026. The scientists work at MIT in the United States. Their paper is in a famous science magazine called Nature.\n\nLater, the team found a small mistake. In one picture, a bar had the wrong name. The bar said 'Pd-Ag under OCP'. But the right name is 'Pd under OCP'. It was only a name problem.\n\nThe scientists wrote a correction. They put it in Nature on 6 October 2026. They fixed the name in the online paper and in the PDF. The science in the paper did not change.\n\nThe paper is about a way to get hydrogen out of a material. The scientists used a metal called palladium. This metal helps the process work better. Hydrogen is important for clean energy.", "body_zh": "一个科学家团队写了一篇关于氢气的论文。论文在2026年9月9日发表。这些科学家在美国的麻省理工学院工作。他们的论文发表在一本著名的科学杂志《自然》上。\n\n后来，团队发现了一个小错误。在一张图里，一个柱子的名字写错了。柱子上写着“Pd-Ag under OCP”。但正确的名字是“Pd under OCP”。这只是一个名字的问题。\n\n科学家们写了一个更正。他们在2026年10月6日把它发表在《自然》上。他们修改了在线论文和PDF里的名字。论文里的科学内容没有改变。\n\n这篇论文讲的是从材料中提取氢气的方法。科学家们使用了一种叫钯的金属。这种金属让这个过程效果更好。氢气对清洁能源很重要。", "text": "A team of scientists wrote a paper about hydrogen. The paper came out on 9 September 2026. The scientists work at MIT in the United States. Their paper is in a famous science magazine called Nature. Later, the team found a small mistake. In one picture, a bar had the wrong name. The bar said 'Pd-Ag under OCP'. But the right name is 'Pd under OCP'. It was only a name problem. The scientists wrote a correction. They put it in Nature on 6 October 2026. They fixed the name in the online paper and in the PDF. The science in the paper did not change. The paper is about a way to get hydrogen out of a material. The scientists used a metal called palladium. This metal helps the process work better. Hydrogen is important for clean energy.", "vocab": [{"word": "scientist", "pos": "noun", "zh": "科学家", "note": ""}, {"word": "paper", "pos": "noun", "zh": "论文", "note": "这里指科学论文"}, {"word": "hydrogen", "pos": "noun", "zh": "氢气", "note": ""}, {"word": "mistake", "pos": "noun", "zh": "错误", "note": ""}, {"word": "correction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "更正", "note": ""}, {"word": "picture", "pos": "noun", "zh": "图片", "note": ""}, {"word": "metal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "金属", "note": ""}, {"word": "energy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "能源", "note": ""}], "title_original": "Author Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H<sub>2</sub> extraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation", "summary_original": "Nature, Published online: 06 October 2026;\ndoi:10.1038/s41586-026-11244-6\nAuthor Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H\n2\nextraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation", "body_original": "Download PDF\nAuthor Correction\nPublished:\n06 October 2026\nAuthor Correction: Anodic Pd membrane H\n2\nextraction enhances thermochemical dehydrogenation\nRui Zeng\n(\n曾瑞\n)\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0002-7577-767X\n1\n,\nJulian Ufert\nORCID:\norcid.org/0009-0004-6031-5773\n2\n,\nBryan Y. Tang\n1\n,\nRyan P. Bisbey\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0001-8699-5077\n1\n&\n…\nYogesh Surendranath\nORCID:\norcid.org/0000-0003-1016-3420\n1\n,\n2\nShow authors\nNature\n(\n2026\n)\nCite this article\nSave article\nView saved research\nThe\nOriginal Article\nwas published on 09 September 2026\nExplore related subjects\nDiscover the latest articles and news in related subjects.\nChemical engineering\nElectrocatalysis\nHeterogeneous catalysis\nCorrection to:\nNature\nhttps://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-11008-2\nPublished online 9 September 2026\nIn the version of th